ys/leading-comma-array.js) was:\n\n``` js\n[\n    ,null\n]\n```\n\nMy `.eslintrc` file is:\n\n``` yaml\nrules:\n  quotes: [2, \"double\"]\nenv:\n  es6: true\n  node: true\n  browser: true\nextends: [\"xo-space\", \"xo-react\"]\n```\n\nAnd the output is:\n\n```\n/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/rules/indent.js:211\n        if (elements.length > 0 && elements[0].loc.start.line === node.loc.sta\n                                              ^\nTypeError: Cannot read property 'loc' of null\n    at checkIndentInArrayOrObjectBlock (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/rules/indent.js:211:47)\n    at EventEmitter.ArrayExpression (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/rules/indent.js:404:13)\n    at EventEmitter.emit (events.js:129:20)\n    at Controller.controller.traverse.enter (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/eslint.js:794:25)\n    at Controller.__execute (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/node_modules/estraverse/estraverse.js:397:31)\n    at Controller.traverse (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/node_modules/estraverse/estraverse.js:495:28)\n    at EventEmitter.module.exports.api.verify (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/eslint.js:787:24)\n    at processText (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/cli-engine.js:200:27)\n    at processFile (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/cli-engine.js:225:12)\n    at /home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/cli-engine.js:321:26\n```\n\nThe case is a bit weird, I agree, but it's still a valid JS code.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/3272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/3272/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":37713618